  "Question": "\\(a=(1,0,2)\\), \\(b=(2,0,4)\\). What is the geometric relationship between these two vectors?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Perpendicular but not collinear",
    "B": "Neither collinear nor perpendicular",
    "C": "Collinear",
    "D": "They must be perpendicular"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(b=2a\\), so they are collinear. Their dot product is \\(2+0+8\\ne 0\\), so they are not perpendicular.",
